{"id":68298,"date":"2023-12-30T10:21:55","date_gmt":"2023-12-30T09:21:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68298"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:20:18","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:20:18","slug":"triatlo-de-agueda","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/triatlo-de-agueda\/","title":{"rendered":"IX Triatlo de \u00c1gueda 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">IX Triatlo de \u00c1gueda 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>IX Triatlo de \u00c1gueda 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas marcadas para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> na cidade de <strong>\u00c1gueda<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. A prestigiada competi\u00e7\u00e3o multidesportiva atrai triatletas e entusiastas de todo o pa\u00eds para disputar percursos velozes e din\u00e2micos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa do evento integra quatro vertentes competitivas na dist\u00e2ncia Sprint: <strong>Triatlo Sprint<\/strong> (nata\u00e7\u00e3o, ciclismo e corrida), <strong>Duatlo Sprint<\/strong> (corrida, ciclismo e corrida), <strong>Aquabike Sprint<\/strong> (nata\u00e7\u00e3o e ciclismo) e <strong>Aquatlo Sprint<\/strong> (nata\u00e7\u00e3o e corrida). O evento assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip pela SincTime, seguran\u00e7a de percurso, abastecimentos na meta e apoio m\u00e9dico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e organizativa est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Clube Desportivo de \u00c1gueda<\/strong> em articula\u00e7\u00e3o com as entidades locais, assegurando elevados padr\u00f5es desportivos e de seguran\u00e7a a todos os participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; wo